  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bugaya BACE Maize &amp; Rice Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: maize and rice.Beneficiaries: 1,237 smallholder farmers (725 male and 512 female).Summary: The project will provide BACE with farm equipment and production inputs to allow farmers open more land as well access improved seed and agro-chemicals; working capital to enable the cooperative bulk produce and attract big buyers who can pay better prices; processing facilities in terms of infrastructure and machinery to add value to maize and rice and expand market opportunities for processed products.</narrative>
  </description>
